{"id":"00318","root":"uni00318_1","name":{"ja":"井河　さくら","en":"Igawa Sakura"},"title":{"ja":"【春の新作】","en":"【New Spring Product】"},"displayName":{"ja":"【春の新作】 井河　さくら","en":"【New Spring Product】 Igawa Sakura"},"element":"Natural","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","roles":[],"traits":["Taimanin"],"release":"2020-04-15","limited":true,"characterId":27,"profile":{"ja":"アサギの妹。いつも明るく陽気で人懐っこい印象を受ける美女。当初、アサギには対魔忍となる事を反対されていたが、姉のように正義のために戦いたいとアサギの反対を押し切って対魔忍となる。その後、カオス・アリーナ、東京キングダムでの死闘ではよく姉を助け、目立たないが優秀な対魔忍として、その名を連ねるまでに。姉同様、カオス・アリーナで淫らな改造を受けたが桐生の手によって治癒、現在は五車学園で教師を務めている。得物は忍者小太刀の二刀流。","en":"Igawa Sakura is Asagi's younger sister. She's a beautiful woman who's always cheerful, lively, and friendly. At first, Asagi opposed her becoming a Taimanin, but Sakura pushed past her sister's objections, wanting to fight for justice like Asagi. Since then she's repeatedly rescued her sister in the brutal battles of Chaos Arena and Tokyo Kingdom, eventually earning a reputation as an unassuming yet outstanding Taimanin. Like her sister, she underwent a lewd modification in Chaos Arena but was healed by Kiryu, and now works as a teacher at Gosha Academy. Her weapon of choice is a pair of ninja short swords."},"illustrator":"カガミ","voiceActor":"黒岩心々","forms":[{"id":"uni00318_1","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1024,2048],"sp":[150,150],"atk":[167,334],"def":[94,188],"spd":[48,48],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":40,"skills":["4","550001"],"evolve":[["evo00010",5],["evo00011",15],["evo00012",5],["evo00017",1]]},{"id":"uni00318_2","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","levelMax":90,"stats":{"hp":[1548,3096],"sp":[250,250],"atk":[269,538],"def":[123,246],"spd":[48,48],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":40,"skills":["4","550001","550002"],"evolve":[["evo00011",10],["evo00012",15],["evo00016",4],["evo00017",2]]},{"id":"uni00318_3","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","levelMax":100,"stats":{"hp":[2072,4143],"sp":[330,330],"atk":[376,750],"def":[157,317],"spd":[48,48],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":40,"skills